---@field endDate? string Output only. Date when the ad group ends serving ads. By default, the ad group ends on the ad group's end date. If this field is set, then the ad group ends at the end of the specified date in the customer's time zone. This field is only available for Microsoft Advertising and Facebook gateway accounts. Format: YYYY-MM-DD Example: 2019-03-14
---@field targetingSetting? gcp.unstable.searchads360_v0.GoogleAdsSearchads360V0Common__TargetingSetting Setting for targeting related features.
