---A campaign budget.
---@class gcp.unstable.searchads360_v0.GoogleAdsSearchads360V0Resources__CampaignBudget
---@field period? gcp.unstable.searchads360_v0.GoogleAdsSearchads360V0Resources__CampaignBudgetPeriodEnum Immutable. Period over which to spend the budget. Defaults to DAILY if not specified.
---@field deliveryMethod? gcp.unstable.searchads360_v0.GoogleAdsSearchads360V0Resources__CampaignBudgetDeliveryMethodEnum The delivery method that determines the rate at which the campaign budget is spent. Defaults to STANDARD if unspecified in a create operation.
---@field resourceName? string Immutable. The resource name of the campaign budget. Campaign budget resource names have the form: `customers/{customer_id}/campaignBudgets/{campaign_budget_id}`
