---A conversion.
---@class gcp.unstable.searchads360_v0.GoogleAdsSearchads360V0Resources__Conversion
---@field floodlightOriginalRevenue? string Output only. The original, unchanged revenue associated with the Floodlight event (in the currency of the current report), before Floodlight currency instruction modifications.
---@field advertiserConversionId? string Output only. For offline conversions, this is an ID provided by advertisers. If an advertiser doesn't specify such an ID, Search Ads 360 generates one. For online conversions, this is equal to the id column or the floodlight_order_id column depending on the advertiser's Floodlight instructions.
---@field merchantId? string Output only. The Search Ads 360 inventory account ID containing the product that was clicked on. Search Ads 360 generates this ID when you link an inventory account in Search Ads 360.
---@field conversionLastModifiedDateTime? string Output only. The timestamp of the last time the conversion was modified.
---@field resourceName? string Output only. The resource name of the conversion. Conversion resource names have the form: `customers/{customer_id}/conversions/{ad_group_id}~{criterion_id}~{ds_conversion_id}`
---@field productLanguageCode? string Output only. The language (ISO-639-1) that has been set for the Merchant Center feed containing data about the product.
---@field productCountryCode? string Output only. The country (ISO-3166-format) registered for the inventory feed that contains the product clicked on.
---@field visitId? string Output only. The Search Ads 360 visit ID that the conversion is attributed to.
---@field conversionQuantity? string Output only. The quantity of items recorded by the conversion, as determined by the qty url parameter. The advertiser is responsible for dynamically populating the parameter (such as number of items sold in the conversion), otherwise it defaults to 1.
---@field status? gcp.unstable.searchads360_v0.GoogleAdsSearchads360V0Resources__ConversionStatusEnum Output only. The status of the conversion, either ENABLED or REMOVED..
---@field conversionVisitDateTime? string Output only. The timestamp of the visit that the conversion is attributed to.
---@field productId? string Output only. The ID of the product clicked on.
---@field productStoreId? string Output only. The store in the Local Inventory Ad that was clicked on. This should match the store IDs used in your local products feed.
---@field productChannel? gcp.unstable.searchads360_v0.GoogleAdsSearchads360V0Resources__ConversionProductChannelEnum Output only. The sales channel of the product that was clicked on: Online or Local.
---@field floodlightOrderId? string Output only. The Floodlight order ID provided by the advertiser for the conversion.
---@field assetId? string Output only. ID of the asset which was interacted with during the conversion event.
---@field id? string Output only. The ID of the conversion
---@field conversionRevenueMicros? string Output only. The adjusted revenue in micros for the conversion event. This will always be in the currency of the serving account.
---@field assetFieldType? gcp.unstable.searchads360_v0.GoogleAdsSearchads360V0Resources__ConversionAssetFieldTypeEnum Output only. Asset field type of the conversion event.
---@field adId? string Output only. Ad ID. A value of 0 indicates that the ad is unattributed.
---@field clickId? string Output only. A unique string, for the visit that the conversion is attributed to, that is passed to the landing page as the click id URL parameter.
---@field criterionId? string Output only. Search Ads 360 criterion ID. A value of 0 indicates that the criterion is unattributed.
---@field attributionType? gcp.unstable.searchads360_v0.GoogleAdsSearchads360V0Resources__ConversionAttributionTypeEnum Output only. What the conversion is attributed to: Visit or Keyword+Ad.
---@field conversionDateTime? string Output only. The timestamp of the conversion event.

